              254 [id=254,shape=rect, label=<<font point-size="34">Cloud SQL Auth Proxy</font><br /><font point-size="19">[Infrastructure Node: cloud-sql-proxy 2.14.1]</font><br /><br /><font point-size="24">Uses private IP and<br />cloudsql-client Workload<br />Identity.</font>>, style=filled, color="#4285f4", fillcolor="#ffffff", fontcolor="#172033"]
