              274 [id=274,shape=rect, label=<<font point-size="34">Workload Identity /<br />GKE metadata server</font><br /><font point-size="19">[Infrastructure Node: GKE Workload Identity Federation]</font><br /><br /><font point-size="24">Provides short-lived<br />Application Default<br />Credentials; no JSON key is<br />mounted.</font>>, style=filled, color="#4285f4", fillcolor="#ffffff", fontcolor="#172033"]
